&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional support role. Our founders need a sharp, low-ego partner who multiplies their impact: someone who thinks clearly, writes clearly, owns projects end to end, and keeps their time focused where their time is needed most. You’ll spend most of your time supporting our CEO, and the rest supporting our Head of Strategic Growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission requires solving problems no one has solved and building capabilities that don’t yet exist. That means operating differently from organizations built to optimize known systems, and it means no role here is beneath anyone. If you have strong judgment and do your best work when you’re trusted with a problem and given room to solve it, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have a front-row seat to how a Physical AI company scales from breakthrough technology to commercial manufacturing, and you will be expected to contribute to it, not just observe it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Santa Clara office with the occasional travel to Emeryville (preferred).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of this role is ownership work. The rest is keeping the founders’ time, travel, and commitments running without friction. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the CEO&#39;s operating rhythm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the trackers, follow-ups, and action items that come out of leadership meetings, and close the loop until each one is done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the briefings and pre-reads that let Jeff walk into board, investor, customer, and candidate conversations ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn long documents and discussions into short, accurate summaries with a clear recommendation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on cross-company projects from the founders’ plate and drive them to completion across teams that don&#39;t report to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft narratives, memos, and communications in Jeff&#39;s voice, at a standard he would sign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot what is broken or drifting, raise it directly, and propose a fix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect the founders’ time and focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the founders’ calendar, priorities, and incoming requests with sharp judgment about what needs him and what doesn&#39;t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate domestic and international travel and logistics so he never has to think about them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a trusted point of contact for our team, investors, customers, and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle highly sensitive information with complete discretion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You think clearly and write clearly.&lt;/strong&gt; You lead with the answer. You can read a 20-page technical narrative and tell someone the decision in three sentences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are accurate.&lt;/strong&gt; You check the details that can&#39;t be wrong, and you have a system for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You form a recommendation.&lt;/strong&gt; When you bring a problem, you bring options and a point of view, not just a question.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You work well with minimal direction.&lt;/strong&gt; You know when to decide, when to ask, and when to escalate, and you&#39;re comfortable working mostly in writing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You seek truth.&lt;/strong&gt; You raise bad news early and push back respectfully when the logic doesn&#39;t hold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You use AI as a force multiplier.&lt;/strong&gt; You can describe specific tools and workflows you use today and where they fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re curious about how things work.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t need a hardware background, but you want to understand the technology, the customers, and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You see your work through.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a track record of staying in roles long enough to see your work through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation for this position also includes equity and benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$175,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt; Atomic Machines is an equal opportunity employer that values diversity and does not discriminate based on characteristics protected by applicable law. We are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including for individuals with disabilities. To request an accommodation, contact&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:rc@atomicmachines.com&quot;&gt; rc@atomicmachines.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;To help our recruiting team manage application volume and respond to candidates more efficiently, Atomic Machines may use AI-assisted tools. &lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;No job description fits your background? You might still be a future Atomizer, if you want to work in a place built on these principles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission first.&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial success is a means, not the objective, and we optimize for long-term value over short-term wins in advancing humanity&#39;s command of matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build what compounds.&lt;/strong&gt; When we take on a problem, we build what would solve every problem like it, because quick fixes add up but capabilities compound.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builders own outcomes.&lt;/strong&gt; Small, self-reliant teams have the context and authority to build, and one person owns each outcome and drives it across the line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reality is the final authority.&lt;/strong&gt; An idea wins on evidence and reasoning, never on tenure, title, consensus, or convention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn fast.&lt;/strong&gt; Learning per unit time is the metric we run on, and every failure should teach us something new and valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Submit your application. We look forward to connecting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt; Atomic Machines is an equal opportunity employer that values diversity and does not discriminate based on characteristics protected by applicable law. We are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including for individuals with disabilities. To request an accommodation, contact&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:rc@atomicmachines.com&quot;&gt; rc@atomicmachines.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;To help our recruiting team manage application volume and respond to candidates more efficiently, Atomic Machines may use AI-assisted tools. &lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

